{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>**A student team project designed to deliver a ~10 minute experience.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiempo</strong> is\u00a0a 3D platformer where every step brings you closer to stopping your rival\u2019s plan to freeze time forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/3b55e74a69915c5f8b10da3cf6fc005c.poster.avif?t=1762213687\" width=900 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/3b55e74a69915c5f8b10da3cf6fc005c.webm?t=1762213687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/3b55e74a69915c5f8b10da3cf6fc005c.mp4?t=1762213687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your unique time powers; pause to halt traps mid-motion, rewind to undo mistakes, and manipulate mechanisms like moving platforms to solve puzzles and outmaneuver enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/09e2648ff456bf5ddc723079048845bc.poster.avif?t=1762213687\" width=900 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/09e2648ff456bf5ddc723079048845bc.webm?t=1762213687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/09e2648ff456bf5ddc723079048845bc.mp4?t=1762213687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every floor of the tower, new challenges emerge: shifting hazards, cunning foes, and clever contraptions designed to block your ascent. Only by mastering your control over time can you reach the top and restore the flow of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/e9c56d87e35c234be710fcaa167805b0.poster.avif?t=1762213687\" width=900 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/e9c56d87e35c234be710fcaa167805b0.webm?t=1762213687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/extras/e9c56d87e35c234be710fcaa167805b0.mp4?t=1762213687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4032250?t=1762213687","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/0a72e892cb873c7392e599c2b2b255e3ea7ab623/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762213687","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/d7ccbc00cb61b1d6353adefe4d672a8a06defc46/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762213687","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032250/d7ccbc00cb61b1d6353adefe4d672a8a06defc46/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762213687","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>**A student team project designed to deliver a ~10 minute experience.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiempo</strong> is\u00a0a 3D platformer where every step brings you closer to stopping your rival\u2019s plan to freeze time forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span c